      "notes": "Add full names and titles for both founders, and one specific achievement at each prior company — for example, 'Built Stripe's developer-dashboard SDK (used by 50K+ developers)' or 'Led product for Notion's API launch.' State directly why your experience at Stripe and Notion makes you the right team to build the CLI that connects the exact tools you built at."
