      "notes": "Add an 18–24 month financial projection slide showing the MRR trajectory, headcount plan, and burn rate that connect the raise amount to your growth targets. A simple three-column model (month 6, month 12, month 18) with MRR, customer count, headcount, and monthly burn is sufficient — it shows investors the founders have a model, not just a runway duration."
