      "notes": "Commit to one raise amount and state the specific milestone it buys: for example, 'We are raising $2.0M to reach $50K MRR, 200 paying customers, and a repeatable PLG motion by Q4 2027.' Remove the three-option structure, which signals that milestone planning is incomplete. Add a use-of-funds breakdown (engineering, GTM, operations) to show operational intent."
