      "status": "warn",
      "evidence": "The title slide states 'Acmecorp — AI-native developer tools for indie SaaS founders.' The ICP is specific (indie SaaS founders) and the category is named (developer tools), but 'AI-native' is unsubstantiated and buzzwordy — no AI evidence appears anywhere in the six slides. The purpose tells an investor what the company IS but not what it DOES or what changes as a result. The common-mistakes list flags statements that are concrete but buzzwordy as a warn-level finding.",
