      "status": "fail",
      "evidence": "The deck shows no retention analysis at all. The traction slide states '$8K MRR, 24 paying customers, 18% MoM growth (last 4 months)' but contains no retention metrics — neither standard monthly retention nor AI-rebased analysis. a16z recommends that AI companies analyze retention rebased from Month 3 to filter out 'AI tourists' who try the product once and leave; this analysis is entirely absent.",
