      "notes": "Add a defensibility section explaining what makes Acmecorp's position durable: the workflow data accumulated as founders use the CLI, the switching cost once the tool is embedded in daily CI/CD and billing workflows, or the vertical specialization (indie SaaS stack only) that a general-purpose orchestration tool cannot match."
